[thin] Fitted sliding label cover: the tile is 1.8 mm thick in its 2.0 mm channel allowance, retaining 0.2 mm face clearance and the complete bulkhead bore. This is the separate cover section; the receiver and its rails carry their own full wall stock.
alternatives: A 3 mm tile needs a 1.2 mm deeper channel, reducing the retained rear-wall backing from 4 mm to 2.8 mm, or a proud tile and moved bulkhead flange plane. Each changes the fitted panel stack.
